        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "pPTWz",
          "name": "cmp/ChatInput · width host",
          "width": 720,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "TDV8W",
              "name": "cmp/ChatInput",
              "context": "ChatInput (@pstdio/ui chat-ui, packages/ui/src/components/chat-ui/components/chat-input.tsx). Editor over a single control row, with an optional attachment tray above.\n\nEvery row of the composer is a bare $composer-ctl-h (28) row: attachment chips, the editor's single-line default (text centred; it grows with content, never shrinks below 28), and every toolbar control. Rows carry NO padding of their own — vertical rhythm is owned entirely by the root's gap (8), so adding or removing a row never changes the spacing around the others.\n\nToolbar contract: [Attach] [actions slot] [Spacer] [Send]. Attach and Send are ChatInput-owned IconButtons; the actions slot is consumer-supplied (the dashboard puts the model selector there). Toolbar controls are OUTLINED: Attach = cmp/IconButton btn='outline', and the model trigger carries a $ds-border stroke, so the controls read as buttons instead of floating glyphs. Send is the ONE exception — cmp/IconButton btn='primary' (accent fill, radius $btn-radius, a rounded square not a circle), and it is not allowed to be taller than the rest: it reads as primary through its accent fill alone, not through size or outline. Streaming swaps arrow-up for a pause icon (lucide 'pause'); disabled drops to btn='disabled'. Attach is icon-only, so it needs a tooltip and aria-label ('Attach files') in code.\n\nModel selection is a cmp/SelectorTrigger in its model configuration (no mark, no leading icon, LabelWrap pl 0, chevron kept when disabled) opening cmp/ModelMenu. Never render the harness and the model as two separate static pills — the harness lives in the ModelMenu header, and a static pill cannot be changed.",
              "reusable": true,
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$ds-bg",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "stroke": "$ds-border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 8,
