          "context": "Chakra Button variant='outline' size='sm' used by ParamEditor searchable selection controls and SearchableMenu triggers. h 32, px 8, gap 7, radius $btn-radius. Label label/S/regular; icons 14px inherit the button fg. Leading icon reflects the selected item. Grouped selections open a searchable child list with a parent selector header. trig theme axis: default | hover | open | disabled.",
